              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kire jik, eponito ŋirwa ŋulu nyenyaraere nabo namuroet ŋin Topes, kori akadipaalat a lokoku a Inom, nai enyarao akadipaalat ŋina earere ŋituŋa, anerae enukete ikes ŋituŋa Topes tari ŋina edaunor akibois ŋina enukio ŋituŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.32",
